LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Woods: ^7If you have information about a threat to national security, you got to tell us."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_PRO_1_VIDEO15
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Woods: ^7Your old man, he was doing okay in Alaska...fucking Hudson showed up..."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_PRO_1_VIDEO16
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1David: ^7Dad! I'm scared...I need help!"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_PRO_1_VIDEO17
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Mason: ^7You're 7 years old David, stop acting like a baby."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_PRO_1_VIDEO19
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Mason: ^7David....wait!"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_PRO_1_VIDEO20
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1David: ^7Go back to the army, like you did when Mom died. "

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_PRO_1_VIDEO22
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Mason: ^7What are you doing here? "

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_PRO_1_VIDEO25
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Hudson: ^7Castro and the Russians are all over Angola, we can't go in. The CIA have buried the mission. Woods, and his squad, no longer exist. "

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_PRO_1_VIDEO26
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Lt. Colonel North: ^7We've got whatever you need, Mason. Name it. "

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_PRO_1_VIDEO27
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Hudson: ^7David can stay with Jenny, like before. She loves having him...he'll be fine. "

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_PRO_1_VIDEO29
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Mason: ^7It's Uncle Woods, son. He'd do it for me. "

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_AFG3_1_VIDEO1
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7I can't figure out Menendez, without getting inside his fucking head."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_AFG3_1_VIDEO3
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7You know his legends better than anyone. Tell me, why does he hate us so much?"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_AFG3_1_VIDEO7
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Salazar: ^7A year later the only thing he ever loved, his sister, Josefina, was crippled in a fire."

REFERENCE           PRESENCE_SAB
LANG_ENGLISH        "Sabotagem"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_AFG3_1_VIDEO8
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Salazar: ^7Raul and his father started over, sold drugs for easy money. They became rich, powerful, legends of Managua."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_AFG3_1_VIDEO10
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7Right, so now Menendez fucking hated America and started running guns in Afghanistan for his own private army..."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_AFG3_1_VIDEO12
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7That was the photo Woods showed us in the Vault, remember?"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO1
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Woods: ^7Hey! I got it!"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO3
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Menendez: ^7Hijo de puta..."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO4
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Menendez: ^7I've been practicing this all fucking week..."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO8
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Woods: ^7Dezzy, we talked about this already, right? You gotta let that Cordis Die shit go, man!"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO9
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Woods: ^7Ahh...come on, dude, come on...breathe! You gotta breathe!"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO10
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Menendez: ^7Ah sh..."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO11
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1M. Shadows: ^7Menendez! What the fuck are you doing?!"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO13
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Synyster Gates: ^7Hey, goddamnit! Our fans are expecting a killer show tonight, so DO NOT fuck this up."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO14
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1M. Shadows: ^7Hey, old timer, you ready to rock?"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO15
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Woods: ^7I'm ready to ROLL, baby!"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO17
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Woods: ^7Oh that shit? Nah, I'm just fucking lazy.  Let's go kill this thing!"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO18
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1M. Shadows: ^7Oorah, double time! That means you, Menendez."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO20
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1M. Shadows: ^7MENENDEZ!"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A7X_1_VIDEO21
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Menendez: ^7Okay! Okay, okay...Adios mio..."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_HAB_1_VIDEO1
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1President Bosworth: ^7Oh my God, what about China?"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_HAB_1_VIDEO2
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Petraeus: ^7Well, all diplomatic contact has ceased, but as you can see... Beijing, Shanghai and Hong Kong...they're in as much danger as we are."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_YEM_1_VIDEO1
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7Did you do it?"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_YEM_1_VIDEO2
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Karma: ^7...I'm in."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_YEM_1_VIDEO3
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Salazar: ^7Fucking A, sister."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_YEM_2_VIDEO3
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1CIA Nerd: ^7Ohh...Hell's bells to buggery...hang on mate..."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_YEM_3_VIDEO1
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7Menendez's network. All countries getting fucked by the New Cold War..."

REFERENCE           MENU_REFUND
LANG_ENGLISH        "Ressarcimento"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_YEM_3_VIDEO2
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7Wait a minute...New York, D.C., The Pentagon..."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_YEM_3_VIDEO5
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7Wh..Wh... All those files have the same prefix...6-1-9...6-1...Six-nineteen..."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_YEM_3_VIDEO6
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7Oh my God. June nineteenth...that's..."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_YEM_3_VIDEO7
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7That's tomorrow. "

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_YEM_3_VIDEO8
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Salazar: ^7(In spanish) June 19th.... \"Freedom day\". The abolition of slavery."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_YEM_3_VIDEO11
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Briggs: ^7We have to move on Yemen right away. No, you have to go in there, capture Menendez for interrogation."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_YEM_3_VIDEO12
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7It's a tr-"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_YEM_3_VIDEO15
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Briggs: ^7You get your team together. You got two hours.\n"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_KAM_1_VIDEO2
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7Unmarked choppers."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_KAM_1_VIDEO4
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7Wait, there! Right there. You see that? That's him! That's him!"

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_KAM_1_VIDEO5
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7Damn it, I lost the feed. DeFalco's jamming the signals."

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_KAM_1_VIDEO6
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Section: ^7He's rigged the ship. We move now. Cut him off at the atrium. "

REFERENCE           VIDSUBTITLES_A2R_1_VIDEO15
LANG_ENGLISH        "^1Woods: ^7Nurse Batshit, where's my smokes?!"

